  "logical_consequences": [
    "The degree-9 quotient has exactly 7 real roots and is squarefree; with real coefficients the remaining two roots form one simple non-real conjugate pair.",
    "Kushel Theorem 22 says GSTP implies a positive simple real spectrum, so the actual AP T_10 is not GSTP with respect to any full proper-cone family.",
